      "title": "Extra channels (JSON)",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "description": "JSON array of {\"id\",\"name\",\"url\",\"genre\"?,\"meta\"?} appended to the dial. meta: {\"kind\":\"somafm\"|\"nightride\",\"station\":\"<id>\"} for those networks' now-playing APIs, {\"kind\":\"icy\"} (default) to probe the stream's own ICY tags, {\"kind\":\"none\"} for no now-playing. Point one at your own stream to make it a channel."
    }
  }
}

